@SampleAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5290

### Upload and index the sample PDF

POST {{SampleAPI_HostAddress}}/owners-manual/questions/embeddings/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=SampleDocumentBoundary

--SampleDocumentBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="manual.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./SampleDocuments/product-manual.pdf
--SampleDocumentBoundary--

### Ask a question (replace documentId with the id returned by the upload)
# example questions for the provided product manual
# How do I make a cup of coffee using a Pod?
# How do I make a cup of coffee using the brew basket?
# What's the product warranty?
# How do I clean the nozzle?
# What brew sizes can I select when using Pods?

POST {{SampleAPI_HostAddress}}/owners-manual/questions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Which parts are replaceable?",
  "documentId": "b9aff117-9db1-4e35-9ee2-a1631b71f8a8"
}

### Get the answer (Replace questionId with the id return in the question response) 

GET {{SampleAPI_HostAddress}}/owners-manual/questions/d7e8afa2-9f22-41eb-8a51-42c09ebaccff
Accept: application/json
###
